  "benefits": "\n- The project cost is ₹6,00,000/- per hectare.\n\n> **Subsidy Distribution:**\n\n\n1. 40% of the project cost for General Category beneficiaries\n1. 60% of the project cost for SC/Women beneficiaries\n\n",
