        "documentsRequired_md": "\n1. Agreement Deed between beneficiary and Fisheries Department.\n1. Date of Birth Certificate (Voter ID/Birth Certificate/Aadhaar/Matriculation Certificate).\n1. Caste Certificate from First Class Magistrate (Tehsildar).\n1. Training Certificate of beneficiary.\n1. Land Record from Tehsil (Own Land - Jamabandi, Nakal Akshizra, Farad) or registered lease deed of minimum 7 years.\n1. Bills/Receipts/Vouchers.\n1. Photographs of farmer with pond.\n1. Detail of Bank Account and PAN Card.\n1. Detailed Project Report (DPR)/Self Contained Proposal (SCP) as per PMMSY guidelines.\n\n<br>\n\n",
